][/dim]visible number carries a label that unambiguously identifies its [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]target. `.` expands it to the complete list, and the first digit of[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]a two-digit jump narrows it to the matching candidates. The Agents [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]show/hide non-run agents toggle moves from `.` to `I`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]agent_jump_footer_panel.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/agent_jump_footer_panel.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-16y[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-16y/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Jump-map sections, document carrier, and pure legend renderer[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]legend[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]legend: enrich MemberJumpMap with per-target labels and status buckets [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plus ordered roster sections, carry the exact published map on detached [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documents (not hint documents or cheap tribe paints) through a new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]AgentPromptPanel sink, and build the width-responsive [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]collapsed/expanded/narrowed legend renderable with its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]uniqueness-preserving packer and unit tests; no visible change.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Dot jump-panel toggle plumbing and the non-run toggle move[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]keymap[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]keymap: add the inert Agents-only toggle_agent_jump_panel action on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]full_stop, move the Agents show/hide non-run agents toggle to a new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]toggle_hide_non_run_agents action on I, narrow toggle_hide_reverted to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Services, and update availability, registry pairs, palette, help, docs, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and keymap tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Jump panel widget, layout, toggle, narrowing, and visual [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]verification[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after legend, keymap[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel: add the AgentJumpPanel widget as the last child of the detail [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]column, wire the sink, visibility, dot toggle, bottom-pin handling, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]first-digit narrowing, add CSS, help and docs, pilot/reliability/visual [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests, live screenshot review, and the Agents golden refresh.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-16y","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-16y.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-fcddff41e1a20da727dc5d3e14ced6b1","started_at":"2026-09-23T14:52:31.888051+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-16y","bbugyi200.athena.sase-16y.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-16y.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-16y.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-16y.land"]}
